-LAMMPS with this package. Details of the download, build, and
-install process for this package using traditional make (not CMake)
-are given in the lib/pace/README file, and scripts are
-provided to help automate the process.  Also see the LAMMPS manual for
-general information on building LAMMPS with external libraries
-using either traditional make or CMake.
+Dependencies and Building:
+
+This package requires the external PACE library and, optionally, the
+TensorFlow C library (libtensorflow).
+
+When building LAMMPS with CMake, these dependencies are managed automatically:
+
+1. PACE Library: The source code is downloaded and built automatically (via PACELIB_URL or LOCAL_ML-PACE).
+
+2. TensorFlow (for pair_style grace):
+  - By default, CMake attempts to locate the TensorFlow C++ library via your Python installation or downloads it automatically.
+
+  - To disable TensorFlow support (and pair_style grace), add `-D NO_GRACE_TF=yes` to your cmake command.
+
+  - To manually specify a TensorFlow library, use -D TF_LIB_FILE=/path/to/libtensorflow_cc.so.
+
+See the LAMMPS manual for more information on building LAMMPS with
+external libraries using CMake.
 
